				<description>&lt;p&gt;Hi All, I just added few more videos showing how to configure your test environment to run your JMeter tests:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;locally on a Vagrant box&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;using remote machines&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;and on Amazon EC2&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;04---create-a-first-test-plan-and-run-it-using-gee-and-a-vagrant-box&#34;&gt;04 - Create a first test plan and run it using Gee and a vagrant box&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Shows how to create a new test plan from a template project.&#xA;Then how to run it using GEE on our local vagrant box.&#xA;&lt;iframe width=&#34;720&#34; height=&#34;410&#34; src=&#34;https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/b4aSFCRY_hs&#34; frameborder=&#34;0&#34; allow=&#34;accelerometer; autoplay; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture&#34; allowfullscreen&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
